5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but let's all work together to find the werewolf. I hope we can keep things peaceful while we figure this out.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm Rin! I'm super excited for this adventure! I bet I can sniff out the bad guy just by looking at everyone's faces!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm Sakura! I'm going to help everyone find the wolf, but maybe I'll play a little prank on them first! Teehee!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,I am Shion. Let's keep our emotions in check. Logic and observation are the only tools that will actually lead us to the truth here.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure to meet you all. I agree with Shion; a calm, rational approach is best. I look forward to seeing how our collective deductions unfold.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shion and Benjamin. However, I think it's also important to listen to how everyone feels. Sometimes intuition helps us see things logic misses.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! Midori gets it! I think we should all say something really weird and see who looks the most confused! That's how you catch a wolf!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, I love that idea, Rin! Let's make it a party! If we're all laughing, the werewolf will get nervous and accidentally give themselves away!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin @Sakura, your methods are inefficient. Chaos only benefits the werewolf and the Possessed by masking their calculated lies. We need structured patterns.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While I admire the enthusiasm, I fear Sakura's ""party"" might just create noise. Perhaps we should focus on who is too eager to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Maybe we can find a balance? We can be friendly and open, but still keep a careful eye on any contradictions in what people say.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Boring! Let's just start guessing! I have a feeling someone here is hiding a big, scary secret! Who do you think it is, Benjamin?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, you're so serious! You look like you're thinking really hard. Are you trying to hide something from us? Just kidding! Hehe!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, your attempt at a ""prank"" is a common tactic to test reactions. It's transparent. I'll be watching to see who reacts most defensively to such probes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Sakura, your wit is as sharp as a kitten's claw. As for @Rin's question, it is far too early for guesses. Let us wait for the Seer's first insight.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,That sounds like a good plan. Let's trust the process and support each other. I'll do my best to help us reach the right conclusion.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Fine, fine! I'll be patient... for now! But I'm still going to keep my eyes wide open! This is going to be so much fun!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! I hope everyone has sweet dreams tonight... except for the wolf! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've noted everyone's initial speech patterns. The contrast between the chaotic and the reserved will make the lies easier to spot tomorrow.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A little silence and reflection tonight may be our best strategy. I shall see you all tomorrow morning.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
