33,1,1,talk,Midori,,Good morning. I've spent some time thinking. I want us to be careful not to rush into an execution without solid evidence.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Morning! I had a dream about a big wolf! I wonder if the Seer found something juicy last night? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! I slept like a baby! I wonder if anyone is feeling a little bit guilty today? Maybe your tummy is rumbling?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your eagerness to force a reveal is interesting. A Seer who reveals too early becomes a target. We should wait for them to speak.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Shion is correct. A premature claim of the Seer role is often a werewolf's gambit to seize control of the narrative. Let us observe.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate the caution. I don't want to put myself or others in danger, but I do believe we can find a path to the truth together.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion is always so grumpy! Maybe he's just grumpy because he's the wolf! What do you think, Sakura? Doesn't he look suspicious?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, Shion is very serious, but that's just how he is! Maybe the wolf is someone who is acting *too* nice? Like... a little angel?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your attempt to deflect by accusing me is a textbook move. It lacks logical grounding and relies entirely on emotional provocation.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a curious dynamic. Rin is pushing for a target, while Sakura is casting a wide, playful net. Both are distracting from the facts.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Let's try to stay calm. @Rin, @Sakura, please don't fight. If we turn on each other, the werewolf wins. We need to be a team.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm not fighting! I'm just playing! But really, if we don't pick someone, we're just waiting to be eaten! We have to be brave!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm being brave! I'm brave enough to say that I think we should all hold hands! But wait, if the wolf is here, they might bite!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Midori's plea for unity is standard, but @Rin's insistence on a quick execution is the most illogical point here. Why the rush, Rin?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I find Rin's impatience quite telling. In a game of information, rushing to a conclusion is usually a sign of someone who fears the evidence.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to accuse anyone unfairly, but the tension is growing. I believe we should look closely at those who are trying to steer the vote.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Rin,,Hey! I'm just trying to help! You guys are all ganging up on me just because I'm energetic! That's not fair!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, don't be sad, Rin! Maybe we can all just vote for the person who looks the most bored? That's my vote! Hehe!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The pattern is clear. Rin's aggression and Sakura's deflection are creating a smokescreen. However, Rin's lack of a logical defense is more glaring.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. While Sakura is eccentric, Rin's behavior is actively counter-productive to the village's survival. The logic points toward Rin.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
